# L §4.5: "A row may state its own known, later than its version's; one before its version's (a window by its first
# day) is refused (LOAD-KNOWN)." (Writer 6: was REFCORE-UNSPECIFIED §4.5.)
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
input x: int

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-03-01
  x = 1 known window(2026-02-01, 2026-04-01) "s"

ask q1: x
=== expect
refused: LOAD-KNOWN ...
